Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:27:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] chore(hipblaslt) Remove unused include (immintrin.h) (#9293)

## Motivation

This PR removes an unused x86 header, `immintrin.h`. Removing improves
ROCm code portability
portability(https://github.com/ROCm/TheRock/issues/5518)

## Technical Details

`immintrin.h` is included but nothing from it is ever used.

## Test Plan

Build hipblaslt and run tests on x86.

## Test Result

Build and tests run successfully on gfx942

## Submission Checklist

- [ * Look over the contributing guidelines at
https://github.com/ROCm/ROCm/blob/develop/CONTRIBUTING.md#pull-requests.
---
 projects/hipblaslt/clients/common/include/hipblaslt_math.hpp | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/projects/hipblaslt/clients/common/include/hipblaslt_math.hpp b/projects/hipblaslt/clients/common/include/hipblaslt_math.hpp
index eae1c5cded9..e0ff52617d5 100644
--- a/projects/hipblaslt/clients/common/include/hipblaslt_math.hpp
+++ b/projects/hipblaslt/clients/common/include/hipblaslt_math.hpp
@@ -30,7 +30,6 @@
 #include <hip/hip_runtime.h>
 #include <hipblaslt/hipblaslt.h>
 #include <hipblaslt/hipblaslt_xfloat32.h>
-#include <immintrin.h>
 #include <type_traits>
 
 /* ============================================================================================ */
@@ -196,4 +195,4 @@ inline __host__ __device__ bool hipblaslt_isnan(std::complex<T> arg,
                                                 std::enable_if_t<std::is_integral<T>::value, int> = 0)
 {
     return false;
-}
\ No newline at end of file
+}
